    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συρράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σῠρό-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dash together, fight with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδηλον ὂν ὁπότε σφίσιν αὐτοῖς
					ξυρράξουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.96
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιμέτωπος συνέρραξε τοῖς Θηβαίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.3.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.5.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰς τὴν μάχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					16.4
				</span></i>
			; of ships, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				20.51
			</span></i>; of rivers, <i>meet with a roar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				17.97
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κουφοτάτου καὶ βαρυτάτου . .
					συρραξάντων διαμάχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.513
				</span></i>
			.</div>
